1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:02,220
(Penny:)Your career is
far too important.

2
00:00:02,220 --> 00:00:04,160
(Wyatt:)Behind every great man
is a nagging woman

3
00:00:04,160 --> 00:00:06,790
(Wyatt:)who won't let him have any fun,
am I right, Leonard?

4
00:00:07,660 --> 00:00:10,600
(Leonard:)Don't I know it.

5
00:00:11,910 --> 00:00:12,900
(Wyatt:)Well, good night, son.

6
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:14,130
(Leonard:)Good night, Wyatt.

7
00:00:14,130 --> 00:00:15,620
(Leonard:)Oh, good
night, honey.

8
00:00:15,620 --> 00:00:17,400
(Wyatt:)Good night.

9
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:20,410
(Howard:)I love you.

10
00:00:22,640 --> 00:00:24,290
(Penny:)Love you, too.

11
00:00:33,120 --> 00:00:34,690
(Sheldon:)Oh, friggety-frak.

12
00:00:34,690 --> 00:00:37,090
(Sheldon:)Not this again.

13
00:00:42,080 --> 00:00:46,370
(Howard:)Three, four, five--
pass go, get 2,000 rupees--

14
00:00:46,370 --> 00:00:48,620
(Howard:)six, seven.

15
00:00:48,620 --> 00:00:51,920
(Howard:)Whoops. Can't go any further.
There's a sacred cow in my way.

16
00:00:51,920 --> 00:00:53,340
(Raj:)Bernadette, please
tell your boyfriend

17
00:00:53,340 --> 00:00:55,160
(Raj:)to cool it with
the cow jokes.

18
00:00:55,160 --> 00:00:56,360
(Bernadette:)It won't help.

19
00:00:56,360 --> 00:00:58,260
(Bernadette:)Once he finds a joke he likes,
he sticks with it.

20
00:00:58,260 --> 00:00:59,500
(Leonard:)Yeah.

21
00:00:59,500 --> 00:01:00,870
(Raj:)Like his haircut material.

